{
 "about": "Which E2E tests a changed file can affect: scripts/e2e.ps1 -Changed reads this. The most specific rule decides for a file: the one with the longest path that is a prefix of it. Server and plugin code maps to the C# tests, the UI (web/, plugins/X/ui/ and the bundles in plugins/X/wwwroot/) to the UI journeys (the ui tag, or the journeys a tab can reach), and a shared contract ('all') to the full gate, which runs both. 'ignore' rules are for files no E2E test can see. A file that matches nothing is treated as a risk and runs the smoke set. RunnerSelfTests checks that every tag, id and path exists and that every plugin folder has a rule, so a new plugin has to say what covers it.",
